SystemRequirements: C++17; FAISS CPU library for the imported faissR package.
    Optional acceleration uses either the Apple SDK
    Metal frameworks on Apple Silicon (macOS 14 or later and Xcode 15 or
    later), or an NVIDIA CUDA Toolkit. RAPIDS cuVS is needed only for CUDA
    nearest-neighbor search from matrix inputs. RAPIDS RAFT/RMM is an optional
    extension, not a core installation requirement. Full-graph multi-GPU
    Leiden/Louvain use package-owned C++ and CUDA kernels.
